# UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer suppressions for darktable.
#
# Syntax: <check-name>:<substring of a source file path or symbol name>
# e.g.    alignment:src/external/LibRaw
#
# Keep this file small and justified. A suppression here hides a real UBSan
# check, so prefer fixing the code. Entries belong here when the undefined
# behaviour lives in third party code we do not control.

# Start empty. Populate from the first full suite run, and record why each
# entry exists.
